{
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "help",
      "type": "text",
      "text": "**How to use this map**\n- Drag host notes from `Exam/Targets` into the zone where you found them. Each one shows as a live card you can open.\n- Drag from the edge of a card to draw an arrow. Label it with how you got there: exploit, creds or tunnel.\n- Double-click empty space to add a text card. Right-click a card to change its color.\n- Need another zone? Right-click empty space and choose **Create group**.",
      "x": 0,
      "y": -250,
      "width": 1520,
      "height": 200
    },
